{"id":"636354","name":"煮年糕","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/636354/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"年糕","amount":"500克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"干香菇","amount":"几个"},{"name":"木耳菜","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好年糕。","img":"images/636354/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成薄片。","img":"images/636354/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋划散。","img":"images/636354/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧热，加油。","img":"images/636354/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋液倒入锅中，快速翻炒均匀。","img":"images/636354/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入稍宽的水，大火烧开。","img":"images/636354/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入年糕片。","img":"images/636354/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下人香菇(香菇提前泡一下，切成丝)，稍煮一会儿。","img":"images/636354/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入盐、鸡精、生抽调味，最后加入木耳菜。","img":"images/636354/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅装盘。","img":"images/636354/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/636354/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}